---
// CertGuard — SSL Certificate Monitoring Service
// Product page for cc3po.com/products/cert-guard
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>CertGuard — SSL Certificate Monitoring | cc3po</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Never lose a customer to an expired SSL certificate again. CertGuard monitors your domains, alerts you before expiry, and auto-renews via ACME." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://cc3po.com/products/cert-guard" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0f;
      --surface: #12121a;
      --border: #1e1e2e;
      --text: #e0e0e8;
      --text-muted: #8888a0;
      --accent: #00d4aa;
      --accent-dim: #009977;
      --danger: #ff4466;
      --warning: #ffaa33;
      --safe: #33dd88;
      --radius: 12px;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      padding: 80px 0 60px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d1a1a 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(0,212,170,0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,170,0.2);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 4px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
    }
    .hero-cta {
      display: inline-flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #0a0a0f;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-outline {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

    /* Stats bar */
    .stats-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 48px;
      padding: 32px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .stat { text-align: center; }
    .stat-value { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* Sections */
    section { padding: 64px 0; }
    section h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    section .subtitle {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    /* How it works */
    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .step {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 28px;
    }
    .step-num {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(0,212,170,0.1);
      color: var(--accent);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .step h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .step p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* Features */
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .feature {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .feature-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .feature h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .feature p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* Pricing */
    .pricing-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }
    .plan {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }
    .plan.popular {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,212,170,0.08);
    }
    .plan.popular::before {
      content: 'Most Popular';
      position: absolute;
      top: -12px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #0a0a0f;
      padding: 3px 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .plan-name { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .plan-price { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 8px 0; }
    .plan-price span { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .plan-desc { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .plan-features { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 24px; flex: 1; }
    .plan-features li {
      padding: 6px 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .plan-features li::before { content: '✓ '; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
    .plan .btn { text-align: center; }

    /* Alert examples */
    .alert-examples {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .alert-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .alert-icon {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .alert-icon.danger { background: rgba(255,68,102,0.15); color: var(--danger); }
    .alert-icon.warning { background: rgba(255,170,51,0.15); color: var(--warning); }
    .alert-icon.safe { background: rgba(51,221,136,0.15); color: var(--safe); }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 32px 0;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .stats-bar { gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .hero { padding: 48px 0 32px; }
      section { padding: 40px 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-badge">🔒 SSL Certificate Monitoring</div>
      <h1>Never lose a customer to an <span>expired certificate</span></h1>
      <p>
        CertGuard monitors your domains 24/7, alerts you 30/14/7 days before expiry,
        and auto-renews via ACME protocol. One less thing to worry about.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-primary">See Plans</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-outline">How It Works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-bar">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">30/14/7</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Alert schedule</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">ACME</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Auto-renewal</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">Telegram</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Daily one-liner</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <section id="how-it-works">
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Set it up in 5 minutes. Forget about it forever.</p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <h3>Add Domains</h3>
          <p>Tell us which domains to monitor. We check the certificate chain, SANs, and issuer details.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <h3>Daily Checks</h3>
          <p>Every 24 hours, CertGuard connects to each domain and inspects the SSL/TLS certificate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <h3>Smart Alerts</h3>
          <p>Get Telegram alerts at 30, 14, and 7 days before expiry. No noise, just what matters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <h3>Auto-Renew (Pro)</h3>
          <p>CertGuard handles ACME challenges and renews certificates automatically. Zero downtime.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features">
      <h2>Features</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Everything you need to keep your certificates healthy.</p>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
          <h3>Certificate Inspection</h3>
          <p>Checks expiry date, issuer, subject, SANs, and chain validity for every monitored domain.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">📡</div>
          <h3>Telegram Alerts</h3>
          <p>Daily one-liner with status summary. Escalating alerts at 30, 14, and 7 days before expiry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔄</div>
          <h3>ACME Auto-Renew</h3>
          <p>Automatic renewal via Let's Encrypt or any ACME-compatible CA. HTTP-01 and DNS-01 challenges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Monthly Reports</h3>
          <p>PDF report with certificate status, renewal history, and compliance summary for your records.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>
          <h3>Wildcard Support</h3>
          <p>Monitor wildcard certificates and all their subdomains. DNS-01 challenge for wildcard renewal.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Instant Setup</h3>
          <p>No agent installation. No open ports. Just add your domains and we handle the rest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="alerts">
      <h2>Alert Examples</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">What you'll see in your Telegram every day.</p>
      <div class="alert-examples">
        <div class="alert-card">
          <div class="alert-icon safe">✓</div>
          <span>🔒 CertGuard — All 12 certificates healthy. Next expiry: example.com (42 days)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="alert-card">
          <div class="alert-icon warning">⚠</div>
          <span>⚠️ CertGuard Alert — api.example.com expires in 14 days. Action recommended.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="alert-card">
          <div class="alert-icon danger">!</div>
          <span>🚨 CertGuard Alert — admin.example.com expires in 7 days. Immediate renewal needed.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="alert-card">
          <div class="alert-icon safe">🔄</div>
          <span>🔄 CertGuard — Auto-renewed *.example.com via ACME. New expiry: 90 days.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing">
      <h2>Simple Pricing</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">No hidden fees. Cancel anytime.</p>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="plan">
          <div class="plan-name">Starter</div>
          <div class="plan-price">$19 <span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="plan-desc">For small projects and personal sites.</div>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>5 domains monitored</li>
            <li>Daily SSL checks</li>
            <li>Telegram alerts (30/14/7 day)</li>
            <li>Monthly PDF report</li>
            <li>Email support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/test_00g3csa9V4Gz4s0001" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe — $19/mo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan popular">
          <div class="plan-name">Professional</div>
          <div class="plan-price">$47 <span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="plan-desc">For growing businesses and agencies.</div>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>20 domains monitored</li>
            <li>Daily SSL checks</li>
            <li>Telegram alerts (30/14/7 day)</li>
            <li>Monthly PDF report</li>
            <li>Priority email support</li>
            <li>Slack/Webhook integration</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/test_5kA7vJ6iJ6Gc4s0001" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe — $47/mo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">
          <div class="plan-name">Enterprise</div>
          <div class="plan-price">$97 <span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="plan-desc">For teams that need zero downtime.</div>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>Unlimited domains</li>
            <li>Daily SSL checks</li>
            <li>Telegram alerts (30/14/7 day)</li>
            <li>Monthly PDF report</li>
            <li>ACME auto-renewal</li>
            <li>Wildcard certificate support</li>
            <li>DNS-01 challenge support</li>
            <li>Slack/Webhook + API access</li>
            <li>Priority support + SLA</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/test_28oaHZ4iJ8Gc4s0001" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe — $97/mo</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq">
      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Common questions about CertGuard.</p>
      <div style="max-width: 700px;">
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>How do you check my certificates?</h3>
          <p>We connect to your domain over TLS and inspect the certificate chain. No agent or open port needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>What is ACME auto-renewal?</h3>
          <p>ACME is the protocol used by Let's Encrypt and other CAs. CertGuard handles the challenge-response automatically to renew certificates before they expire.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>Can I monitor internal domains?</h3>
          <p>Yes, as long as they're reachable over the internet. For internal-only domains, we can set up a private check endpoint.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>What happens if a certificate expires?</h3>
          <p>We alert you at 30, 14, and 7 days. If it expires despite alerts, we help you renew and get back online quickly. Enterprise plans include auto-renewal to prevent this entirely.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>CertGuard by cc3po — SSL Certificate Monitoring, Alerts &amp; Auto-Renewal</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><a href="https://cc3po.com" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;">cc3po.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
